      "raw": "<p>The rules *seem* a little ambiguous (to me).&nbsp; Do you have to declare the use of these *before* rolling the dice? It seems that Hero Point bonuses, being bonuses, have to be declared before the roll.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But Collections are different.&nbsp; It would be lousy if you declare in advance that you're using one and it has no practical effect.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>How do you play it?</p>",
